    "detailed_description": "You are alone in a deserted station. Or are you? Take pictures of strange anomalies around the station and you might find a way out.<br><br><strong>Use your camera and keep your eyes open.<br><br>Check every corner for anything strange. If you find an anomaly, take a picture quickly.<br><br>When you're ready, it's time to board the train.<br><br>And maybe you can finally go home.</strong><br><br>The Anomalous Hour is a short horror-themed adventure/walking simulator taking place in a mysterious deserted subway station. The only way out is to take photos of the anomalies you find. Don't avert your eyes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2>15-60 minutes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2>\u30fbStreaming this game is permitted to both individuals and corporations without additional permission from Gambir Studio.<br>\u30fbAdditionally, monetization of videos or streaming of this game is also likewise permitted<br>\u30fbPlease kindly mention the name of the game in the title of your video or stream, and consider including a link to the Steam page in the video's description.<br><br>Gambir Studio is not liable for any damages caused by any content creation, including streaming, of this game.<br>These guidelines are subject to change without notice.",
